s, cancellation and dispute counters) is context only and was not used as a ground.\n\nEvidence quality and escalation. The trace is clean: 113 fixes, 10 s interval, 100.0% coverage, no gaps, max gap 0.0 s, so it is not impaired under POL-RD-07(a)-(c) and no gap-handling discount applies. No POL-RD-10 trigger fires: identifiers and timestamps match across the three artifacts; no uncited exculpatory clause is invoked against a cited artifact; the (nil) refund is far below both SGD 150.00 and charged_total; there is no mutually contradictory evidence of comparable strength; and no charge line lacks a counterpart. The case is decided, not escalated. Confidence 0.95 rests on EV-GPS-02841 and EV-TRIP-02841, both weight 1.0, which carry the deciding fact."
